Fifteen Leyline spells. Same Iron’s rules as every other school — scrolls, books, rarity tiers. The school focus is the **Ley Crystal**.

## Leyline Charges

Casting **Beam**, **Ley Blast**, **Eclipse**, or **Fissure** adds one Leyline Charge (max 5). A small HUD tracks them. Death clears the bar.

Spend charges with:

- **Leyline Discharge** — channel, then dump stored charges into aggressive foes in sight
- **Ley Blast** — each charge adds damage and mana cost
- **Ley Resonance** — heal yourself and nearby allies; stronger per charge, then releases them

Build with the cheap hits. Dump with Discharge or Resonance when the bar is full.

## The list

