<img src="/images/leylines/charge_leyline.png" alt="Charge Leyline" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Charge Leyline</strong>
<p>Channels into a nearby Leyline Pillar. Three casts open a rift. 40 mana, 5s cooldown, rare, max level 1. This is the world-content spell — keep one equipped at night.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/blink_step.png" alt="Blink Step" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Blink Step</strong>
<p>Blink in the direction you are moving (or facing if still), then a short haste surge. Panic button.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/beam.png" alt="Beam" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Beam</strong>
<p>Instant ley beam. Hits the first foe in your line of sight. Builds a Leyline Charge.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/tether_gaze.png" alt="Tether Gaze" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Tether Gaze</strong>
<p>Lock onto a foe. When the cast resolves, they freeze (Time Stop).</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/ley_veil.png" alt="Ley Veil" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Ley Veil</strong>
<p>Cloak yourself. Higher power lasts longer and can break enemy focus / clear aggro.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/leyline_discharge.png" alt="Leyline Discharge" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Leyline Discharge</strong>
<p>Long cast that spends every stored Leyline Charge on aggressive foes in sight.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/ley_blast.png" alt="Ley Blast" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Ley Blast</strong>
<p>Lock and blast. Builds a charge on cast; also scales damage and mana with how many charges you already hold.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/ley_eclipse.png" alt="Eclipse" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Eclipse</strong>
<p>Area ley darkness. Builds a Leyline Charge.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/ley_resonance.png" alt="Ley Resonance" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Ley Resonance</strong>
<p>Channel heal for you and nearby allies. Extra hearts per Leyline Charge, then the charges clear.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/rift_gate.png" alt="Rift Gate" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Rift Gate</strong>
<p>Place a ley portal, cast again to link a second. Walk through to travel between them. Camp pin + cave exit.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/chrono_tether.png" alt="Chrono Tether" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Chrono Tether</strong>
<p>Slow foes in a cone ahead of you. You get a brief haste.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/fissure.png" alt="Fissure" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Fissure</strong>
<p>Tear the ground along a line. Damage and knock foes upward. Builds a Leyline Charge.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/temporal_stutter.png" alt="Temporal Stutter" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Temporal Stutter</strong>
<p>Instant freeze on one target. Mid-swing interrupt.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/anchor_recall.png" alt="Anchor Recall" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Anchor Recall</strong>
<p>First cast sets a leyline anchor. Second cast yanks you back before the window expires. Chat says “Leyline anchor set.”</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wiki-item">
<img src="/images/leylines/summon_nightborn.png" alt="Summon Nightborn" width="40" height="40" />
<div>
<strong>Summon Nightborn</strong>
<p>Call a Nightborn Elf ally for a timed duration. Same species as the Thicket merchants — this one fights for you.</p>
</div>
</div>

Gear that leans into the school: the **Leyline Codex** (+10% ley power, +200 mana) and **Ley Staff** (+15% ley power, +100 mana, +5% spell power). Both need a Ley Crystal.
